Relationship to DeepSeek
------------------------

DSH Enterprise / OwnDsh is an independent project. It is not affiliated with,
endorsed by, or sponsored by DeepSeek AI or Anywhere Labs. Names, code, and
trademarks of DeepSeek Harness and DSH Desktop remain the property of their
respective owners.

The plugin baseline and employee desktop client pin both reference DeepSeek
Harness apps/desktop under the MIT license at the same fixed commit. That
source tree is not vendored in this repository. apps/desktop in this repository
is only a packaging layer: it can apply a DSH Enterprise product name, icons,
and bundled plugin tarballs while invoking the official package scripts. The
resulting package must identify the upstream MIT project and must not be
described as official DeepSeek software.

